        }
      ],
      "style": {
        "background": "#29241c",
        "color": "#f3e7ce",
        "borderColor": "#c18c58",
        "borderWidth": 2,
        "borderStyle": "solid",
        "borderRadius": 14
      },
      "visible": true,
      "showLabel": true,
      "data": {
        "content": {
          "kind": "markdown",
          "value": "# Strengths & Flaws\n\n## Strengths\n\n**Exceptional intellect:** Extensive knowledge of ancient history, archaeology, and languages.\n\n**Improvisation:** Turns desperate situations into opportunities.\n\n**Resilience:** Keeps fighting long after a sensible person would surrender.\n\n**Moral courage:** Frequently risks his life to protect others and preserve history.\n\n---\n\n## Weaknesses\n\n**Ophidiophobia:** An intense fear of snakes.\n\n**Impulsiveness:** Sometimes acts before considering the consequences.\n\n**Obsession:** His pursuit of historical mysteries can damage relationships.\n\n**Physical vulnerability:** He gets injured, exhausted and overwhelmed.\n\n**Pride:** He sometimes confuses stubbornness with certainty."
        },
        "memo": "",
        "link": "",
        "identity": {
          "graphId": "cfef98fa-2f89-4b39-b69f-b2bbcfc3ba74"
        },
        "_placement": {
          "version": 1,
          "state": "manually-shaped",
          "source": "manual",
          "updatedAt": 1793837095582,
          "reason": "node-drag"
        }
      }
    },
